comment.narrative:
21-04-2023: By the end of 2022, Make Way collaborating partners felt enough confidence to implement trainings on intersectional SRHR L&A themselves targetting additional youth-led CSOs. 

in October, CDSK and FAWE gave a training on Budget Cycle and Advocacy, to prepare the consortium's advocacy work on health financing; 

In November, one collaborating partner trained fellow youth-led CSO on intersectionality and SRH advocacy. It also created a WhatsApp Group to discuss more on issues related to SRH services and how they can go about it.
